    scope: 'This chart’s source snapshot contains 11,429 catalog records. It summarizes dated subject-heading mentions, not unique books: one book can contribute several mentions, and a long date range contributes in every year it covers. The newer subject-themes source contains 11,846 records; the chart and map cohorts have not yet been rebuilt to that catalog snapshot. It distinguishes Russia, Poland, other powers, and Ukraine’s own headings; shared places are not assigned to Russia or Poland.',
